<title>USA: Bass group raises Sotheby's stake to 10.3pct.</title>
<headline>Bass group raises Sotheby's stake to 10.3pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by the wealthy Bass family of Fort Worth, Texas, said Friday it raised its stake in Sotheby's Holdings Inc to 10.3 percent from 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission the group said it bought 202,100 additional shares of the auction house between October 18 and 24 at prices ranging from $16.03 to $16.53 a share.</p>
</text>
